		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Humanoid wrapped in bloody gauze, flesh embedded with razor blades and iron nails. Eldest kyton.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 50, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 claws +8 (1d10 + eviscerate) and 1 graft, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +6, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Eviscerate</strong>. CON 15+ or kyton removes flesh, body part, or vital organ. 1d8 permanent attribute loss (determine randomly).</p><p></p><p><strong>Graft</strong>. 1/day, kyton can add eviscerated flesh into its body, healing all damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 1d6 HP on its turn. Does not regenerate if wounded by a silver weapon.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
